This directory contains the vendored Codex history/protocol source closure
used by TermLink's Codex Rollout Collector.

Upstream project: OpenAI Codex
Upstream revision: 5ee6baee2fcc0b6ffd413d9611f5538dad40d0f2
License: Apache-2.0

The closure is promoted from the repository-local compatibility Spike. It is
kept as a checked-in source boundary so the formal collector does not depend
on a developer's Codex checkout or on a Codex workspace download.
